 "instructions": "50 questions in five parts: English meaning (1–10), Urdu meaning (11–20), synonym (21–30), antonym (31–40) and HEC-style sentences (41–50). Q1–Q25 are past-paper words, Q26–Q50 new words at the same level. No negative marking. Paper bands: 45–50 strong, 38–44 good (revise the missed words), below 38 re-learn the list and retest in two days.",
 "source": {
